WEBVTT

00:03:56.691 --> 00:04:00.111
have the ability to reorganize
and form new connections

00:04:00.152 --> 00:04:01.862
all throughout our lives.

00:04:01.904 --> 00:04:04.490
A good first step is to do the basics.

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:05.783
Eat a balanced diet,

00:04:05.783 --> 00:04:06.951
exercise regularly

00:04:06.993 --> 00:04:08.452
and get plenty of sleep,

00:04:08.452 --> 00:04:10.538
as your mind is part of your body.

00:04:10.579 --> 00:04:12.873
It might also help to try meditation.

00:04:12.915 --> 00:04:16.043
Instead of our heart rate rising
and our body tensing,

00:04:16.085 --> 00:04:18.546
with mindfulness and breathing,

00:04:18.546 --> 00:04:21.382
we can slow down
the fight-or-flight response

00:04:21.382 --> 00:04:24.302
and improve how we feel in the moment.

00:04:24.343 --> 00:04:27.638
Cognitive behavioral therapy,
a form of talk therapy,

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:29.223
can also be fantastic.

00:04:29.265 --> 00:04:31.642
In it, you learn to identify
upsetting thoughts